  "title": "Inspiring Learning The Latest Eth Community Magazine Life Has Been Released",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The October edition of life , ETH's community magazine, gives you the results of the 2015 student survey . You can read why for Rector Sarah Springman, it is all about independent learning and the feeling of being part of the university community.\n\nAnd Lukas Vonesch, the new Head of HR , speaks about the autonomy of ETH members, their competitive position, and the areas he wants to focus on.\n\nYou'll also get a glimpse into the working life of the ETH Store , the ETH Zurich Industry Relations Team and the Pioneer Fellow , Claudia Kuster."
    }
